{"id":"634446","name":"凉拌秋葵藕片","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/634446/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"秋葵","amount":"6-7根"},{"name":"藕","amount":"半根"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"5瓣"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"藕去皮切片。","img":"images/634446/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"开水烫熟。","img":"images/634446/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"秋葵洗干净，开水烫熟。","img":"images/634446/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出藕片，秋葵对半切开。","img":"images/634446/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜切成末，热油后，下入蒜末炸香。","img":"images/634446/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盛出蒜末，加入香菜，加2勺蒸鱼豉油。","img":"images/634446/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加小米辣，加1勺醋。","img":"images/634446/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调匀料汁，倒入秋葵和藕片中。","img":"images/634446/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"凉拌。","img":"images/634446/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}